  "goodToKnow": "Die Kleinanzeige is a classified ad: eine Kleinanzeige aufgeben (to place one). Germans buy and sell second-hand furniture, bikes and prams on the platform Kleinanzeigen, called eBay Kleinanzeigen until 2023; a common question there is Ist das noch da? (is it still available?), and haggling (VB, Verhandlungsbasis, means price negotiable) is normal. Die Anzeige alone means an ad, a display, or a police report: Anzeige erstatten."
